blocks.en:
Component analysis of GPDPO. To understand the contribution of each design choice in GPDPO, we conduct ablations on four variants:
(1) GPDPO (Strict Pareto Dominance), which requires strict improvement on every reward dimension instead of allowing ties;
(2) GPDPO (Scalarized Reward Ordering), which replaces Pareto-based comparisons with ordering based on an aggregated scalar reward;
(3) GPDPO (Fixed Reference Model), which keeps the initial policy as the reference model throughout training;
and (4) GPDPO (Pareto-Guided Advantage Adjustment), which incorporates recovered Pareto relations by modifying advantages instead of directly optimizing preference margins.
All variants are evaluated on Qwen3-1.7B under 2R setting (Table 3 ).

blocks.zh:
GPDPO的组件分析. 为了理解GPDPO中每个设计选择的贡献,我们用四个变体进行拼贴:
(1) GPDPO(Strict Pareto Dominance),它要求严格改进每个奖励方面,而不是允许挂钩;
(2) GPDPO(分级奖励令),以总的分级奖励取代基于Pareto的比较;
(3) GPDPO(Fixed Information Model),将初始政策作为整个培训的参考模式;
和(4)GPDPO(Pareto-Guided Advantage Regulation),它通过修改优势而不是直接优化优惠幅度,将恢复的Pareto关系纳入其中.
所有变体在2R设置下在Quen3-1.7B上评价(表3 ).
